<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Intl Multifoods raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Intl Multifoods raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it upgraded International Multifoods Corp to near-term accumulate from neutral.</p>
<p>-- said raised long-term rating to buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- International Multifoods was up 1/2 to 25-1/8.</p>
</text>
